            <p class="eyebrow">Why Pet Choice</p>

            <h2>A field guide, not a shopping list</h2>

            <p>
                Pet Choice is designed to help cat lovers explore
                different cat breeds stored in a PostgreSQL database.
                Create a free account to browse breed information, search
                using multiple filters, and view detailed descriptions —
                Administrators can also manage breed records through full
                CRUD operations from a dedicated dashboard.
            </p>

            <p>
                Whether you're a first-time cat owner or a lifelong
                feline enthusiast, Pet Choice makes it easy to compare
                temperament, lifespan, grooming needs, and origin so
                you can find a companion that truly fits your lifestyle.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="about-highlights">

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🐱</div>
                <h3>Curated Breeds</h3>
