            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
                <h3>Smart Search</h3>
                <p>Filter by name, origin, temperament, coat type and grooming level.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🗄️</div>
                <h3>Database Powered</h3>
                <p>Built on PostgreSQL with full create, read, update and delete support.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
                <h3>Secure by Design</h3>
                <p>Passwords are hashed with bcrypt, account recovery uses one-time verification codes, and access is role-based for Administrators and Viewers.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

